          "author": "Tumble Media",
          "description": "Get ready to delve into the delightful world of bugs and critters! This card answers quirky questions like, \"Do bugs have elbows?\" and uncovers the incredible tales of ants and their conquering ways. Learn about the mesmerizing code of flashing fireflies and discover the wildlife that might be living right in your backyard. Plus, you'll be enchanted by the surprising songs of spiders! ",
